Xwayland: let the compositor hold X11 clients until its startup step finishes

wlr_xwayland_hold_clients() opens a private init display, starts Xwayland
with -initfd on it and delays the X11 window manager (and so WM_S0, which
opens the normal sockets) until wlr_xwayland_release_clients().
wlr_xwayland_server_get_init_display_name() gives the init DISPLAY.

